\n[asker_nameDef] is asking us to bring [nickname] to one of their settlements for a grand sum of [bounty] silver, double if alive. They are hiding in a safe house and it's probably guarded.
\nIf we clear out their camp, [allRewardsDescriptions]-->
    <li>questDescription-&gt;[asker_nameFull]、[asker_faction_name] 的 [asker_faction_leaderTitle] 向我们致敬。显然，臭名昭著的 [siteFaction_name] 的 [criminal_nameFull] 就藏在我们附近。

[asker_nameDef] 要求我们将 [nickname] 带到他们的一个定居点，以获取一大笔 [bounty] 银子，如果活着的话，银子是双倍的。他们躲在一个安全屋里，而且可能有人看守。

如果我们清理掉他们的营地，[allRewardsDescriptions]</li>
