  <VFES_CaravanRaid.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>[asker_faction_name]的[asker_faction_leaderTitle][asker_nameFull]向我们透露了一条消息。看起来，旅途中的[siteFaction_pawnsPlural]与他们的驮运动物正在我们附近的某处停歇。\n[asker_nameDef]告诉了我们这支商队的落脚处，或许可以打他们一个措手不及。<!--EN: questDescription->[asker_nameFull], [asker_faction_leaderTitle] of [asker_faction_name], has sent us a message. Apparently, [siteFaction_pawnsPlural] are resting with their beasts before continuing their journey.
            \n[asker_nameDef] gave us their location, if we want to, we can go attack them.-->
    <li>[asker_faction_name] 的 questDescription-&gt;[asker_nameFull]、[asker_faction_leaderTitle] 向我们发送了一条消息。显然，[siteFaction_pawnsPlural]正在和他们的野兽一起休息，然后继续他们的旅程。
 
[asker_nameDef]给了我们他们的位置，如果我们愿意，我们可以去攻击他们。</li></VFES_CaravanRaid.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
